 "titulo": "You wake up in a medieval monastery 🔔 Part 1 #history #shorts",
 "capa": "2 AM, EVERY NIGHT",
 "descripcion": "In a medieval monastery, the day started at 2 in the morning, and almost nobody spoke. Monks talked with their hands.\n\nSources: Rule of Saint Benedict (chapters 16, 42, 48); Cluniac sign lists.\n\nCould you live in silence?\n\n#history #medieval #middleages #historyfacts #shorts",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "You wake up in a monastery, in the year 1200. It's two in the morning.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "A bell is ringing. You're fifteen, a novice, sleeping in your robe.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "You walk to the church with forty monks, in the dark.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The night prayer. Psalms, sung slowly, in Latin. The stone is freezing.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then back to bed for a while, until the dawn prayer.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Your day is cut into eight prayer times, from the dark to the dark again.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "And almost all of it happens in silence.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "So the monks talk with their hands. Some houses used more than a hundred signs.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Want bread? Make a circle with your thumbs and fingers.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Want fish? Wiggle your hand, like a tail in the water.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Your rule says idleness is the enemy of the soul.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "In the garden, you pull weeds and carry water to the beans.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Your hands blister. Nobody complains. Nobody can.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "After the evening prayer, the abbot calls you to his room.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He hands you a goose feather, and a knife.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "You have a steady hand, he signs. You'll copy a book.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "It will take you a year. Part two, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
